.TH "user:create" 1 "September 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
user:create \- Provisions a new framework user account.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php user:create
\fIusername\fR [\-\-email=\fIEMAIL\fR] [\-\-password=\fIPASS\fR] [\-\-role=\fIROLE\fR] [\-\-json] [\-\-app=\fIAPP\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a new user record with bcrypt-hashed credentials and optional role mapping.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-email =\fIEMAIL\fR
User's contact email.
.TP
.BR \-\-password =\fIPASS\fR
Plaintext password to hash and store.
.TP
.BR \-\-role =\fIROLE\fR
Initial assigned role.
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Outputs results in structured JSON format.
.TP
.BR \-\-app =\fIAPP\fR
Targets a specific application context.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Validates uniqueness, executes password_hash(), inserts row into spp_users, and associates roles.
